        "category": "plugin",
        "severity": "error",
        "description": "Give this long-lived operation an explicit lifetime and cleanup. Effect.never waits for interruption and leaves termination to cancellation elsewhere. Use Stream or acquire/release to express the operation's lifetime and resource release together.",
